---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { AUTHOR_NAME, CONTACT_EMAIL, LAST_UPDATED, LEGAL, SITE_NAMES, SITE_URL } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
import { displayDate } from '../../lib/format';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title={`Legal notice and publisher – ${SITE_NAMES[lang]}`} description="Oikea sähkön hinta’s publisher, host, liability, copyright and applicable law. The site works out the Finnish spot electricity price with transfer fee, tax and VAT included." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Legal notice' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Legal notice and publisher details</h1>
    <h2>Publisher</h2>
    <LegalIdentity lang={lang} />
    <p>Responsible for the content of {SITE_URL}: {AUTHOR_NAME}.</p>
    <h2>Host</h2>
    <LegalIdentity mode="hosting" lang={lang} />
    <h2>What the site does</h2>
    <p>Oikea sähkön hinta turns the Finnish bidding-zone exchange price into an all-in price per kilowatt-hour: the retailer’s margin or fixed price, the network operator’s transfer fee from its own price list, electricity tax and the security-of-supply fee from the Tax Administration’s table, and VAT. Results are <strong>estimates</strong>. Your retailer’s and network operator’s bills are what count. The site is independent, sells no contracts and has no link to energy companies, network operators, the power exchange or public authorities. Method and limits: <a href={route('method', lang)}>method and sources</a>.</p>
    <h2>Liability</h2>
    <p>Prices and taxes are checked against their sources and the engine is tested automatically, but operators may change prices during the year and no guarantee of accuracy can be given. When the day’s exchange prices are unavailable, a marked average-price estimate is shown. The publisher is not liable for decisions made on the basis of an estimate alone. Report errors via the <a href={route('contact', lang)}>contact page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Copyright and data</h2>
    <p>Texts, graphics and code belong to the publisher. Statistics Finland data are used under CC BY 4.0 with attribution. Exchange prices are published by the power exchange and ENTSO-E, whose terms of use continue to apply. Legal texts are public.</p>
    <h2>Embedding</h2><p>The calculator may be embedded free of charge with a visible link: see <a href={route('widget', lang)}>Embed the calculator</a>.</p>
    <h2>Personal data and cookies</h2><p>What you type stays in your browser. See the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies</a>.</p>
    <h2>Reporting content</h2><p><a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>, with the page address and the reason.</p>
    <h2>Applicable law</h2><p>French law, where the publisher is established. Disputes are settled amicably first, otherwise by the competent court ({LEGAL.jurisdiction}); a consumer keeps the protection of the law of their home country. Updated {displayDate(LAST_UPDATED, 'en-GB')}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
